{% comment %}
  Wagmart Privacy Policy Data & Sections Snippet
  - Tailored to Wagmart Pet Care & Pet Supplies store context
  - Uses Wagmart brand font (Nunito)
  - Modular data file rendered by sections/main-privacy-policy.liquid
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .wagmart-privacy-sections {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    font-family: 'Nunito', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .wagmart-privacy-sections {
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }

  .wagmart-policy-heading {
    font-family: 'Nunito', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.28;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111514;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .wagmart-policy-heading {
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .wagmart-policy-heading {
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
  }

  .wagmart-policy-text {
    font-family: 'Nunito', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 25px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #4C4D4D;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .wagmart-policy-text {
      font-size: 16.5px;
      line-height: 27px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .wagmart-policy-text {
      font-size: 17.5px;
      line-height: 28px;
    }
  }

  .wagmart-policy-bullets {
    list-style-type: disc !important;
    padding-left: 22px !important;
    margin-top: 10px !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }
  .wagmart-policy-bullets li {
    font-family: 'Nunito', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 25px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #4C4D4D;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .wagmart-policy-bullets li {
      font-size: 16.5px;
      line-height: 27px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .wagmart-policy-bullets li {
      font-size: 17.5px;
      line-height: 28px;
    }
  }
  .wagmart-policy-bullets li::marker {
    color: #7a46e5;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .wagmart-policy-link {
    color: #7a46e5;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .wagmart-policy-link:hover {
    color: #6332c9;
  }
</style>

<div class="wagmart-privacy-sections">

  {% comment %} Introduction {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">Introduction</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      This Privacy Policy explains how Wagmart collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you access our website or shop for pet care supplies, grooming essentials, food, and accessories. We are committed to maintaining the privacy, confidentiality, and security of your personal data while ensuring a joyful and trustworthy shopping experience for you and your pets. By browsing our store or placing an order, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
    </p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 1. Information We Collect {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      We may collect the following types of information when you use our website or purchase our pet products:
    </p>
    <ul class="wagmart-policy-bullets">
      <li><strong>Personal Details:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, delivery address, and billing information.</li>
      <li><strong>Pet &amp; Order Information:</strong> Pet preferences (dog/cat, breed, size), product wishlists, purchase history, and feedback.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical Information:</strong> IP address, device type, browser details, and shopping navigation patterns.</li>
      <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> Customer login details, saved addresses, order tracking preferences, and communication choices.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 2. How We Use Your Information {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      We use the information collected to:
    </p>
    <ul class="wagmart-policy-bullets">
      <li>Process and fulfill orders, arrange doorstep courier delivery, and process payments securely.</li>
      <li>Improve our pet supplies catalog, customer service, and overall online shopping experience.</li>
      <li>Communicate order status, tracking updates, delivery notifications, and customer support follow-ups.</li>
      <li>Provide tailored pet product recommendations and seasonal pet care promotions.</li>
      <li>Comply with applicable legal, taxation, and e-commerce regulatory requirements.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 3. How We Protect Your Information {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">3. How We Protect Your Information</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      While no method of electronic transmission over the internet or storage system is 100% secure, we implement industry-leading standards to safeguard your data.
    </p>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data:
    </p>
    <ul class="wagmart-policy-bullets">
      <li>End-to-end SSL/TLS encryption for all orders, customer accounts, and payment transactions.</li>
      <li>Restricted, role-based access granted solely to authorized pet care support personnel.</li>
      <li>Continuous monitoring, firewalls, and regular security audits on our systems.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 4. Sharing Your Information {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      We never sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We share your data only with trusted partners strictly necessary for store operations:
    </p>
    <ul class="wagmart-policy-bullets">
      <li>Logistics and courier partners to deliver your pet orders directly to your address.</li>
      <li>PCI-compliant payment gateways and fraud prevention systems.</li>
      <li>Legal and regulatory authorities when strictly required by applicable law.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 5. Cookies and Tracking {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">5. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      You can manage cookie settings through your browser preferences at any time.
    </p>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience on our website. These help us:
    </p>
    <ul class="wagmart-policy-bullets">
      <li>Remember your shopping cart items, wishlist, and preferred currency.</li>
      <li>Understand user behavior, popular pet categories, and browsing preferences.</li>
      <li>Improve website performance, page loading speeds, and checkout functionality.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 6. Your Rights {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      As a Wagmart customer, you have full control over your information:
    </p>
    <ul class="wagmart-policy-bullets">
      <li>Access, update, or request deletion of your account and personal details.</li>
      <li>Correct inaccurate or outdated delivery and contact information.</li>
      <li>Unsubscribe from promotional emails or marketing notifications at any time.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 7. Third-Party Links {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">7. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      Our website may contain links to partner websites, social media channels, or external resources. Wagmart is not responsible for the content, security, or privacy policies of third-party websites.
    </p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 8. Updates to This Policy {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">8. Updates to This Policy</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our store operations, new pet services, or legal obligations. Revisions will be posted here with an updated "Last updated" date.
    </p>
  </div>

  {% comment %} 9. Contact Us {% endcomment %}
  <div class="wagmart-privacy-block">
    <h2 class="wagmart-policy-heading">9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p class="wagmart-policy-text">
      If you have questions, feedback, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or your pet data, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@wagmart.com" class="wagmart-policy-link">support@wagmart.com</a>, call us at <a href="tel:+917777985896" class="wagmart-policy-link">+91 77779 85896</a>, or reach us via our <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" class="wagmart-policy-link">Contact Page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>
